[
  {
    "id": 0,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "少しほろ苦くて、表面はパリッと、\n中はホロホロ……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Slightly bitter, with a crispy surface and a crumbly center..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アンチュ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Antje"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 1,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "アンチュ。あなたは何をしていますの？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Antje. What are you doing?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ララ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lara"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 2,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ララ……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lara..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アンチュ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Antje"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 3,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "なるほど。それで手渡すまでクリセルダには\n内緒にしたいというわけですのね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I see. So you want to keep it a secret from Criselda until you give it to her."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ララ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lara"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 4,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "そのほうが、きちんと気持ちを伝えられると思って……\nでも、一人じゃなかなか上手く作れないの",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I thought it would help me convey my feelings better... But I'm having trouble making it on my own."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アンチュ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Antje"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 5,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "手伝って……もらえない、かしら？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Could you... help me?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アンチュ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Antje"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 6,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ふふ。もちろんですわ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Hehe. But of course."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ララ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lara"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 7,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "もっとも、あちらは面白いことになっている\nようですが……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Though it seems things are getting rather interesting over there..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ララ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lara"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 8,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ねえ。ララ・キングダムでも、リンデ祭に\n何か催しをするの？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Say, is the Kingdom of Lara holding any events for Linde Festival?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アンチュ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Antje"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 9,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ええ。全国民にチョコを配ることにしています",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yes. I've decided to distribute chocolate to all citizens."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ララ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lara"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 10,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ララならみんなに慕われてるから……\nむしろ全国民からチョコが集まりそうね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "You're so beloved by everyone... You'd probably receive chocolate from every citizen instead."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アンチュ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Antje"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 11,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "あら。王の慈愛は見返りなど求めていません。\n民は王の庇護を受けていれば良いのです",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "My. A queen's benevolence seeks no reward. The people need only bask in their sovereign's protection."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ララ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lara"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 12,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "そう……なのね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I... see."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アンチュ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Antje"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 13,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "どうかしましたの？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Is something the matter?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ララ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lara"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 14,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "私……この間のお茶会で、嫉妬心を抱いたの。\nクリセルダが誰かのお嫁さんに、なんて思ったら……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "At that tea party before... I felt jealous. When I thought about Criselda becoming someone's bride..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アンチュ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Antje"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 15,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "私、クリセルダにただ感謝の気持ちを\n伝えたいだけじゃなくて……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Maybe I don't just want to express my gratitude to Criselda..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アンチュ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Antje"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 16,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "そばにいてほしいから、そんな見返りが欲しいから、\nチョコを渡したいのかもしれない……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Maybe I want to give her chocolate because I want her to stay by my side... because I want something in return..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アンチュ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Antje"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 17,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "それでも良いと思いますよ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "There's nothing wrong with that."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ララ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lara"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 18,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "え、でも……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "But..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アンチュ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Antje"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 19,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "そんな気持ちを抱かれることを嬉しく思う者も\nいるのですから",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Some people would be delighted to have such feelings directed at them."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ララ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lara"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 20,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "（むしろクリセルダなら、間違いなく\n\u3000歓喜しますわね）",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(In fact, Criselda would undoubtedly be overjoyed.)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ララ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lara"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 21,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "そう……かな？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "You think so...?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アンチュ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Antje"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 22,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "私……クリセルダにそばにいてほしい。\nでも、重荷になりたくない",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I... want Criselda to stay by my side. But I don't want to be a burden."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アンチュ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Antje"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 23,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "だから、クリセルダに寄りかかるんじゃなく、\n自分で立って、頼れる私になりたい",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "So instead of leaning on her, I want to stand on my own two feet and become someone she can rely on."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アンチュ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Antje"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 24,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "そんな気持ちを……\n「ありがとう」って気持ちと一緒に伝えたい",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I want to tell her how I feel... along with my 'thank you.'"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アンチュ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Antje"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 25,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ええ。そのまま伝えるのが良いと思いますわ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yes. I think you should tell her exactly that."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ララ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lara"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 26,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "さぁ、贈りものにふさわしい最高の一品に向けて……\n仕上げといきましょう",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Now then, let's put the finishing touches on something worthy of being a gift."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ララ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lara"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 27,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "うん……！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yeah...!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アンチュ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Antje"
        }
      }
    }
  }
]